## First element of `l` strictly greater than `threshold`.
##
## ## Parámetros
## - `l`: the list to scan. Read only.
## - `threshold`: exclusive lower bound to beat.
##
## ## Retorno
## `some x` for the first match, or `maybe none`. Borrows `l`.
##
## ## Ejemplo
